        "Id": "0d5e1623-7e6c-44de-9e7a-0321aa8960c7",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Cupcake Conspiracy",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122906853378",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a07921d5-b47e-4f0a-b8a7-3a5f0d6f0f5a).Image",
        "Description": "47, we got intel that Helen West and James Burton put prototype Microchips into their cupcakes. Top-Secret documents reveal that said chips put any consumer under mind control. It is on you to stop Burton and West to save America. \rYou also have to eliminate their henchmen. The mind control has gone too far and cannot be reverted any longer. You will also recieve a bonus if you eliminate Burton with his own medicine. A lethal dose of microchips is located in the basement of the cupcake house.",
